{"html_text": {"ja423:0.1": "<article id='ja423'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja423:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja423:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja423:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja423:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja423:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja423:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja423:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja423:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja423:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja423:7.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:7.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:7.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:7.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:7.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:7.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja423:8.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:8.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:8.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:8.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja423:9.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:9.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:9.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja423:9.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja423:10.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja423:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja423:0.2": "Aṭṭhakanipāta ", "ja423:0.3": "Kaccānivagga ", "ja423:0.4": "7. Indriyajātaka ", "ja423:1.1": "“Yo indriyānaṁ kāmena, ", "ja423:1.2": "vasaṁ nārada gacchati; ", "ja423:1.3": "So pariccajjubho loke, ", "ja423:1.4": "jīvantova visussati. ", "ja423:2.1": "Sukhassānantaraṁ dukkhaṁ, ", "ja423:2.2": "dukkhassānantaraṁ sukhaṁ; ", "ja423:2.3": "Sosi patto sukhā dukkhaṁ, ", "ja423:2.4": "pāṭikaṅkha varaṁ sukhaṁ. ", "ja423:3.1": "Kicchakāle kicchasaho, ", "ja423:3.2": "yo kicchaṁ nātivattati; ", "ja423:3.3": "Sa kicchantaṁ sukhaṁ dhīro, ", "ja423:3.4": "yogaṁ samadhigacchati. ", "ja423:4.1": "Na heva kāmāna kāmā, ", "ja423:4.2": "nānatthā nātthakāraṇā; ", "ja423:4.3": "Na katañca niraṅkatvā, ", "ja423:4.4": "dhammā cavitumarahasi”. ", "ja423:5.1": "“Dakkhaṁ gahapatī sādhu, ", "ja423:5.2": "saṁvibhajjañca bhojanaṁ; ", "ja423:5.3": "Ahāso atthalābhesu, ", "ja423:5.4": "atthabyāpatti abyatho”. ", "ja423:6.1": "“Ettāvatetaṁ paṇḍiccaṁ, ", "ja423:6.2": "api so devilo bravi; ", "ja423:6.3": "Na yito kiñci pāpiyo, ", "ja423:6.4": "yo indriyānaṁ vasaṁ vaje”. ", "ja423:7.1": "“Amittānaṁva hatthatthaṁ, ", "ja423:7.2": "sivi pappoti māmiva; ", "ja423:7.3": "Kammaṁ vijjañca dakkheyyaṁ, ", "ja423:7.4": "vivāhaṁ sīlamaddavaṁ; ", "ja423:7.5": "Ete ca yase hāpetvā, ", "ja423:7.6": "nibbatto sehi kammehi. ", "ja423:8.1": "Sohaṁ sahassajīnova, ", "ja423:8.2": "abandhu aparāyaṇo; ", "ja423:8.3": "Ariyadhammā apakkanto, ", "ja423:8.4": "yathā peto tathevahaṁ. ", "ja423:9.1": "Sukhakāme dukkhāpetvā, ", "ja423:9.2": "āpannosmi padaṁ imaṁ; ", "ja423:9.3": "So sukhaṁ nādhigacchāmi, ", "ja423:9.4": "ṭhito bhāṇumatāmivā”ti. ", "ja423:10.1": "Indriyajātakaṁ sattamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja423:0.1": "", "ja423:0.2": "", "ja423:0.3": "", "ja423:0.4": "", "ja423:1.1": "", "ja423:1.2": "", "ja423:1.3": "", "ja423:1.4": "jīvantova visussati → jīvantopi visussati (sya1ed, sya2ed); jīvareva visussati (pts-vp-pli1); jīvanto vāpi sussati (mr) ", "ja423:2.1": "", "ja423:2.2": "", "ja423:2.3": "Sosi → sopi (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1, mr) | sukhā → sukha (sya1ed, sya2ed); sukhaṁ (mr) ", "ja423:2.4": "", "ja423:3.1": "", "ja423:3.2": "", "ja423:3.3": "", "ja423:3.4": "", "ja423:4.1": "", "ja423:4.2": "", "ja423:4.3": "", "ja423:4.4": "", "ja423:5.1": "gahapatī → gahapatiṁ (bj); gahapataṁ (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1); gahavataṁ (?) ", "ja423:5.2": "", "ja423:5.3": "", "ja423:5.4": "", "ja423:6.1": "Ettāvatetaṁ → ettāva tesaṁ (bj); ettāvatā te (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja423:6.2": "api so → asito (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) | devilo → devalo (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja423:6.3": "", "ja423:6.4": "", "ja423:7.1": "", "ja423:7.2": "", "ja423:7.3": "", "ja423:7.4": "", "ja423:7.5": "", "ja423:7.6": "", "ja423:8.1": "", "ja423:8.2": "", "ja423:8.3": "", "ja423:8.4": "", "ja423:9.1": "", "ja423:9.2": "", "ja423:9.3": "", "ja423:9.4": "ṭhito → cito (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja423:10.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja423:0.1": "", "ja423:0.2": "", "ja423:0.3": "", "ja423:0.4": "", "ja423:1.1": "ms22J_1738, msdiv60, pts-vp-pli3.464", "ja423:1.2": "", "ja423:1.3": "", "ja423:1.4": "", "ja423:2.1": "ms22J_1739, msdiv61", "ja423:2.2": "", "ja423:2.3": "", "ja423:2.4": "", "ja423:3.1": "ms22J_1740, msdiv62, pts-vp-pli3.465, sya27.248", "ja423:3.2": "", "ja423:3.3": "", "ja423:3.4": "", "ja423:4.1": "dr27.247, ms22J_1741, msdiv63, pts-vp-pli3.466", "ja423:4.2": "", "ja423:4.3": "", "ja423:4.4": "", "ja423:5.1": "bj30.316, ms22J_1742, msdiv64, ndp22.175", "ja423:5.2": "", "ja423:5.3": "", "ja423:5.4": "", "ja423:6.1": "ms22J_1743, msdiv65", "ja423:6.2": "", "ja423:6.3": "", "ja423:6.4": "", "ja423:7.1": "ms22J_1744, msdiv66, pts-vp-pli3.468", "ja423: